    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2399570/extras/6b22405fe1087a3ee8211aef69f52e75.webp?t=1749397752\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to your new Skystead! It\u2019s looking a bit worse for wear at the moment but that\u2019s nothing you and your enchanted crook can\u2019t fix. Starting with a desolate rock floating above the heavens, it\u2019s your task to bring your Skystead back to life! Garden, ranch, and terraform your plot into a sanctuary teeming with life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2399570/extras/5ac9cb75b375a47d88bff5b95801c546.webp?t=1749397752\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It won\u2019t be long before your efforts to revive your Skystead are noticed. Friendly creatures we call Skylets will start to appear! Use your notebook to record all you learn about them; their likes, dislikes, and quirks will reveal themselves to you. Don\u2019t forget to take pictures with your Skylets to record them at their best! Some Skylets might need some more persuading before they feel comfortable enough to stay permanently on your Skystead Ranch, but in no time at all they will begin to call your Skystead home!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2399570/extras/a92f6d693644ec1d6fdb439a86f329b9.webp?t=1749397752\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No Skystead would be complete without a garden. Plough the soil, then the choice is yours: dig yourself a pond; grow a meadow; or just have a large lawn, it's up to you. Some of your new friends will like your garden in a certain way, while others will have other preferences. You'll need to plant crops, grow trees and bushes, and feed your new friends if you want to have the best Skystead in the world! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2399570/extras/9749e4734b061c0577340d071a175b4c.webp?t=1749397752\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now you have a garden and some new companions, it\u2019s time to build bridges\u2026 literally! Construct large projects like a Pier for Skyships to dock with, a House to live in and upgrade, or clear out the old mine entrance to unlock a new zone. Not all constructions are mega projects though; protect your farms with fencing, drywall, or even a scarecrow or two! Make your Skystead your own with a selection of cosmetic and functional building options!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2399570/extras/5939c31af92675896b3a296f7d2ad8a8.webp?t=1749397752\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your Skystead begins to take shape, you will find yourself unlocking new areas, construction options, and mechanics. Discover fishing, photography, and cooking while you make your Skystead the best around. Seek out and explore every cave and cliff face\u2026 who knows what you will unlock and which unique Skylets you might meet!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2399570/extras/6b22405fe1087a3ee8211aef69f52e75.webp?t=1749397752\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to your new Skystead! It\u2019s looking a bit worse for wear at the moment but that\u2019s nothing you and your enchanted crook can\u2019t fix. Starting with a desolate rock floating above the heavens, it\u2019s your task to bring your Skystead back to life! Garden, ranch, and terraform your plot into a sanctuary teeming with life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2399570/extras/5ac9cb75b375a47d88bff5b95801c546.webp?t=1749397752\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It won\u2019t be long before your efforts to revive your Skystead are noticed. Friendly creatures we call Skylets will start to appear! Use your notebook to record all you learn about them; their likes, dislikes, and quirks will reveal themselves to you. Don\u2019t forget to take pictures with your Skylets to record them at their best! Some Skylets might need some more persuading before they feel comfortable enough to stay permanently on your Skystead Ranch, but in no time at all they will begin to call your Skystead home!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2399570/extras/a92f6d693644ec1d6fdb439a86f329b9.webp?t=1749397752\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No Skystead would be complete without a garden. Plough the soil, then the choice is yours: dig yourself a pond; grow a meadow; or just have a large lawn, it's up to you. Some of your new friends will like your garden in a certain way, while others will have other preferences. You'll need to plant crops, grow trees and bushes, and feed your new friends if you want to have the best Skystead in the world! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2399570/extras/9749e4734b061c0577340d071a175b4c.webp?t=1749397752\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now you have a garden and some new companions, it\u2019s time to build bridges\u2026 literally! Construct large projects like a Pier for Skyships to dock with, a House to live in and upgrade, or clear out the old mine entrance to unlock a new zone. Not all constructions are mega projects though; protect your farms with fencing, drywall, or even a scarecrow or two! Make your Skystead your own with a selection of cosmetic and functional building options!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2399570/extras/5939c31af92675896b3a296f7d2ad8a8.webp?t=1749397752\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your Skystead begins to take shape, you will find yourself unlocking new areas, construction options, and mechanics. Discover fishing, photography, and cooking while you make your Skystead the best around. Seek out and explore every cave and cliff face\u2026 who knows what you will unlock and which unique Skylets you might meet!</p>",
    "short_description": "Transform a desolate sky island into a vibrant sanctuary. Using your enchanted crook, cultivate your garden, befriend quirky creatures, build a home, and unlock secrets along the way. Each choice adds a personal touch to your unique Skystead Ranch!",
